# Build artifacts. run_fuzz.sh builds inside the container into /work/bin, but
# keep these patterns so a manual in-tree build stays untracked.
build/
*.o
*.log
*_asan_ubsan
*_asan_lsan

# Seed corpora: NOT tracked, because gen_corpus.py reproduces them exactly
# (verified: regeneration yields identical counts) and 1188 files is noise in
# review. run_fuzz.sh generates them automatically when absent, so a fresh
# clone still fuzzes productively from exec #1 — every seed is a document PAIR
# whose key names already line up, which random mutation would take a long time
# to rediscover. SAVE_CORPUS=1 also drops campaign-discovered inputs here;
# prune with `-merge=1` (see README.md) if you ever do want to keep some.
corpus_*/

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#
#   crashes/     Reproducers are evidence. Every artifact here must also be
#                turned into a deterministic unit test in ../test_syncer.c —
#                the corpus is not a regression suite, test_syncer.c is.
